  "reading": {
    "zh": "只在开发机用，**不进 exe**。设计上就是“一个脚本管一件事”：想知道 exe 怎么来的看构建组（面板注入链路的离线自测也在这里），要发版看发布组，程序里某张表要重生成看数据组。",
    "en": "Dev-machine only, never shipped inside the exe. One script per job by design — read the build group if you wonder how the exe is made (it also holds the panel's offline injection self-test), the release group if you are publishing, and the data group when a table in the program needs regenerating."
  },
